  "description": "NOMAD is LEADER’s fixed gear adventure bike. A chromoly frame with a supple ride and room for tires up to 50C, built to take the street with you wherever the pavement ends.\n\nTrack geometry meets 50C.\n\nFrames with around 35C of clearance are nothing unusual in TRACKLOCROSS and FGFS. Keeping a fixed gear’s solid speed off-road takes more tire, so NOMAD clears up to 50C without giving up a tight rear end. A bent seat tube and plate-style chainstays, both purpose-designed, make room for the tire (the plates double as reinforcement) while keeping the fixed gear look and ride.\n\nMounts for extension.\n\nMounts on the top tube, the down tube (top and bottom), the fork and the seat stays. Pack a tent for bikepacking, or add fenders and a rear rack for a daily-bike feel.\n\nBUILT TO GO BEYOND.\n\nStreet or dirt. No need to choose.NOMAD keeps the agile feel of a LEADER, with the supple ride of chromoly underneath and room to build it up your way. Not specialized for gravel racing or long-distance touring, it moves seamlessly from easy rides around town to playing in the dirt.\n\nNot specialized for gravel racing or long-distance touring. Built for everything from easy rides around town to playing in the dirt. Run it fixed or free, your choice.",
